      "experiments/records/source-independent-key-floor-audit/source-manifest.json"
    ],
    "representation": "Pinned 29-rune source transcription of the 55 nonempty LP2 pages before AN END and PARABLE; 12,956 runes. A separate Unicode-rune parser checks the count without using source gematria code.",
    "procedure": "Run the D2 source's planted-English control and recount; compare an independent parser; inspect B4 G3 source prerequisites and saved values; enumerate all independent uniform keys in a three-symbol logical control.",
    "parameters": "D2's LP2 stream, per-page adjacency, 54 page joins, the B4 predeclared five-large-corpus rule, the implemented four-corpus loop, and all 3^4 keys of the finite control.",
    "exclusions": "No new LP2 key or plaintext search. No re-estimation of the English floor without the absent source corpora. No claim that the finite control makes iid uniform keys likely on LP2."
  },
